  "state_only_concepts": [
    "weekly_holiday",
    "annual_leave",
    "child_labour",
    "night_work_women",
    "rest_interval",
    "employment_registration"
  ],

  "_state_only_note": [
    "Concepts whose only in-force primary anchors are STATE legislation, because",
    "this corpus contains no Central equivalent. The Karnataka Shops Act supplies",
    "weekly holidays, annual leave, rest intervals, night-work limits, child",
    "labour and establishment registration; the Central corpus (IDA/PGA/COW) has",
    "no counterpart. Listing them here suppresses the build-time 'no Central",
    "anchor' error, but retrieval still filters them by jurisdiction, so a user",
    "outside Karnataka asking about weekly holidays correctly gets an honest",
    "'not covered for your state' rather than Karnataka law presented as theirs.",
    "Ingest a Central equivalent (e.g. the OSH Code 2020) and these should move",
    "out of this list."
  ],

